        "base": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/feed/",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_13 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_16\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_18  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>We&#8217;re aware of an outage impacting the Westport region.</p>\n<p>We&#8217;re currently investigating and will provide more information when we can.</p>\n<p><strong>Update 3:30pm:</strong> We&#8217;ve identified the issue and services have been restored, however, some schools may experience intermittent service disruption while further remediation work is completed.</p>\n<p><strong>Update Wednesday 20 May, 9am:</strong><span>\u00a0The issue has now been resolved and service has been restored. If you\u2019re still experiencing issues, please contact our Customer Support team on 0800 532 764.</span></p>\n<p><span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/outage-impacting-the-westport-region/\">Outage impacting the Westport region</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
      }
